{"id":27576,"date":"2026-02-23T17:46:55","date_gmt":"2026-02-23T17:46:55","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/sakuraindustries.com\/newweb\/?page_id=27576"},"modified":"2026-04-18T09:42:29","modified_gmt":"2026-04-18T09:42:29","slug":"about-our-products","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/sakuraindustries.com\/newweb\/about-our-products\/","title":{"rendered":"About Our Products"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"27576\" class=\"elementor elementor-27576\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wd-negative-gap elementor-element elementor-element-a7107bf e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"a7107bf\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bc2e4d5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"bc2e4d5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a3a1b36 text-content elementor-widget elementor-widget-wd_text_block\" data-id=\"a3a1b36\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"wd_text_block.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wd-text-block reset-last-child text-left\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<h4>Sakura Industries Attributes<\/h4><h2><em>Product Information<\/em><\/h2><p>Not all instruments are created equal. Adequate for the job is, in reality, inadequate.\u00a0A better instrument reduces distractions and facilitates operations.\u00a0 A better instrument helps a surgeon perform at his\/her best.\u00a0A better instrument leads to better results.\u00a0Sakura Industries provides better instruments.<\/p><p>Whether crafted from German surgical grade stainless steel, or machined from Japanese surgical grade stainless steel, our instruments are recognized by their finely finished surface. They are designed to perform with precise surgical function and are also conceived to be affordable. It is this combination that distinguishes the Sakura Industries.<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b68f8fb e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b68f8fb\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-396f62e elementor-widget elementor-widget-wd_image_or_svg\" data-id=\"396f62e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"wd_image_or_svg.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"wd-image text-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" src=\"https:\/\/sakuraindustries.com\/newweb\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/21.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/sakuraindustries.com\/newweb\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/21.jpg 600w, https:\/\/sakuraindustries.com\/newweb\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/21-400x267.jpg 400w, https:\/\/sakuraindustries.com\/newweb\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/21-430x287.jpg 430w, https:\/\/sakuraindustries.com\/newweb\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/21-150x100.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"wd-negative-gap elementor-element elementor-element-982c2bc e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"982c2bc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2bb22f0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2bb22f0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-827fbc2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-wd_image_or_svg\" data-id=\"827fbc2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"wd_image_or_svg.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"wd-image text-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" src=\"https:\/\/sakuraindustries.com\/newweb\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/22.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/sakuraindustries.com\/newweb\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/22.jpg 600w, https:\/\/sakuraindustries.com\/newweb\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/22-400x267.jpg 400w, https:\/\/sakuraindustries.com\/newweb\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/22-430x287.jpg 430w, https:\/\/sakuraindustries.com\/newweb\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/22-150x100.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a723691 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a723691\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-57505e7 text-content elementor-widget elementor-widget-wd_text_block\" data-id=\"57505e7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"wd_text_block.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wd-text-block reset-last-child text-left\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<h2><em>Sakura Industries Manufacturing<\/em><\/h2><p>Sakura Industries instruments are manufactured from stainless steel.\u00a0 Stainless steel, though not truly stainless, is a highly corrosion and rust-resistant material.\u00a0 The metal is extremely strong and durable and has the ability to form protective or \u201cpassivation\u201d layers.<\/p><p>Stainless steel differs from carbon steel by the amount of chromium present. Unprotected carbon steel rusts readily when exposed to air and moisture. This iron oxide film (the rust) is active and accelerates corrosion by forming more iron oxide. Stainless steels contain sufficient chromium to form a passive film of chromium oxide, which prevents further surface corrosion and blocks corrosion from spreading into the metal\u2019s internal structure.\u00a0 Passivation only occurs if the proportion of chromium is high enough.<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"wd-negative-gap elementor-element elementor-element-f9ec76d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"f9ec76d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3581d80 text-content elementor-widget elementor-widget-wd_text_block\" data-id=\"3581d80\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"wd_text_block.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wd-text-block reset-last-child text-left\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Manufacturing Process<\/h2><p>Most gSource surgical instruments are made from German stainless steel type 1.4021 \u2013 equivalent to American steel type 420.\u00a0 This steel is highly corrosion resistant and has excellent longevity when properly maintained.\u00a0 Steel type 1.4021 is composed primarily of iron. Other components are:<\/p><table class=\"bordered\"><tbody><tr><td>Carbon<\/td><td>0.17-0.25%<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Silicon<\/td><td>\u2264 1.0%<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Manganese<\/td><td>\u2264 1.0%<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Phosphorous<\/td><td>\u2264 0.045%<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Sulphur<\/td><td>\u2264 0.043%<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Chromium<\/td><td>12.0-14.0%<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><p>During the manufacturing process every effort is made to ensure that the instruments are corrosion resistant.\u00a0 However, if not properly maintained, stainless steel can rust and stain, reducing the life of the instrument or rendering it useless. For more detailed information on instrument care,\u00a0see our\u00a0Instrument Care &amp; Cleaning instructions.<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"wd-negative-gap elementor-element elementor-element-508a220 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"508a220\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a8fd78c text-content elementor-widget elementor-widget-wd_text_block\" data-id=\"a8fd78c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"wd_text_block.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wd-text-block reset-last-child text-left\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<h2><em>Heat Treatment<\/em><\/h2><p>Heat treating makes the instruments hard and enables them to withstand rigorous use.\u00a0 Stainless steel is brought to a very high temperature and then cooled until it has reached the proper hardness.\u00a0 Hardness is measured in units called Rockwell Hardness (HRc).\u00a0 A typical hardness range for needle holders is HRc 40-48.\u00a0 For scissors, the range is HRc 50-58.<\/p><p>Heat treating and steel selection are just two of the more than 80 steps required to produce surgical instruments to Sakura Industries standards. We monitor and verify the accuracy of our manufacturing process through frequent audits.<\/p><p>See\u00a0Making of a Surgical &amp; Beauty Instrument\u00a0for some of the steps required.<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Sakura Industries Attributes Product Information Not all instruments are created equal. Adequate for the job is, in reality, inadequate.\u00a0A better<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,